flowchart TD
    A([Open app]) --> B[Restore accounts from localStorage or defaults]
    B --> C[/Submit credentials/]
    C --> D{Hash matches browser account object?}
    D -- No --> E[/Reject login/]
    E --> C
    D -- Yes --> F[Set currentUsername and sessionUsername]
    F --> G[Hide navigation not listed in allowedPages]
    G --> H{User stays in normal UI?}
    H -- Yes --> I[/Staff sees Dashboard, POS, Sales/]
    I --> J([Normal use])
    H -- No --> K[/Edit localStorage or expose hidden DOM/]
    K --> L[Reload or invoke privileged UI code]
    L --> M{Server authorization check?}
    M -- None --> N[/Privileged pages and actions become available/]
    N --> O([Authorization bypass])
